WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:34.806
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:35.076 --> 00:36.703
All right, I'm listening.

3
00:36.786 --> 00:37.912
Here's what I noticed.

4
00:37.996 --> 00:40.165
The way he moves isn't ordinary.

5
00:40.248 --> 00:41.249
Like Chiara's.

6
00:41.332 --> 00:43.585
Better dig deeper, Agent Dara.

7
00:49.090 --> 00:52.051
But did you know Viktor was transferred to another prison?

8
00:52.677 --> 00:53.511
When did that happen?

9
00:53.595 --> 00:55.013
They didn't report it to me.

10
00:55.096 --> 00:56.431
I only found out just now.

11
00:56.514 --> 00:58.683
But it looks like they transferred him the other night.

12
00:58.767 --> 01:01.269
To the most secluded area,

13
01:01.352 --> 01:03.897
and Viktor was transferred to maximum security.

14
01:06.941 --> 01:08.610
You criminals sure do talk a lot.

15
01:08.693 --> 01:10.695
Boss, just relax.

16
01:11.613 --> 01:13.865
This guy from Prague looks tough, huh?

17
01:13.948 --> 01:14.783
All right, then.

18
01:14.866 --> 01:16.326
Let's teach him a lesson.

19
01:17.619 --> 01:18.620
Boss, that's enough.

20
01:19.913 --> 01:21.456
You don't have to do this anymore.

21
01:22.082 --> 01:23.666
I'll take it all!

22
01:30.465 --> 01:32.342
I don't think I've seen her around here before.

23
01:32.425 --> 01:34.677
Maybe she's attending the wedding.

24
01:34.761 --> 01:35.720
Huh?!

25
01:36.387 --> 01:38.890
We only invited a few people.

26
01:39.849 --> 01:41.643
Maybe she's from Chiara's side.

27
01:41.726 --> 01:43.853
And you know Chiara and I only wanted our closest friends and family

28
01:43.937 --> 01:46.648
to be invited to the wedding.

29
01:50.735 --> 01:51.778
Mom?

30
01:57.408 --> 02:01.621
We were just talking about how he misses his mom.

31
02:01.704 --> 02:03.915
And now they finally meet!

32
02:03.998 --> 02:06.960
That's so nice for Rahmboy!

33
02:13.967 --> 02:15.385
Mama Yaya?

34
02:18.888 --> 02:20.431
Mom!

35
02:28.314 --> 02:30.900
I've missed you.

36
02:31.526 --> 02:33.319
That's Rahmboy's mother!

37
02:33.903 --> 02:34.737
Rahmboy?

38
02:37.157 --> 02:40.160
I've missed you so much.

39
02:45.790 --> 02:47.375
Look how big you've gotten!

40
02:47.458 --> 02:52.589
You used to be a baby crying to Mom because you had poop in your butt.

41
02:54.215 --> 02:55.174
Look at you now!

42
02:55.258 --> 02:59.220
You're even taller than me, aren't you, son?

43
02:59.304 --> 03:00.471
Mom.

44
03:00.972 --> 03:04.183
Mom, you're embarrassing me in front of Aunt Tess and Uncle Mario.

45
03:04.767 --> 03:08.062
Come on, Rahmboy. It's okay! Your mom is really funny.

46
03:08.146 --> 03:09.522
By the way, I'm Tess!

47
03:09.606 --> 03:10.773
Tess.

48
03:10.857 --> 03:11.900
I'm Mario.

49
03:12.984 --> 03:14.736
Mario and Tess.

50
03:14.819 --> 03:15.778
Mari-Tess?

51
03:15.862 --> 03:18.031
What a perfect match!

52
03:18.114 --> 03:21.159
Like a love team, just like QuenDrea.

53
03:21.242 --> 03:24.162
Vicky, you're really keeping up with everything.

54
03:24.245 --> 03:27.206
Of course! I have a Gen-Z kid.

55
03:27.290 --> 03:29.876
So I'm always updated on the latest trends.

56
03:29.959 --> 03:32.837
Right! Like mother, like son.

57
03:32.921 --> 03:37.133
Oh, Vicky, did you know? Rahmboy livestreams all day.

58
03:40.386 --> 03:41.304
Mama Yaya.

59
03:48.770 --> 03:49.646
My dear.

60
03:49.729 --> 03:50.855
My dear.

61
04:05.119 --> 04:06.246
Mama Yaya?

62
04:07.830 --> 04:10.750
What do you mean? Are you and Chiara siblings?

63
04:10.833 --> 04:13.503
No, we're not. I don't get it either.

64
04:17.465 --> 04:21.928
Mama Yaya raised and took care of me when I was a child.

65
04:22.011 --> 04:25.139
She's always there when I trained in Sicily.

66
04:26.391 --> 04:29.310
The only one who's very special to me.

67
04:32.230 --> 04:34.565
-Hello. -Hello, ma'am.

68
04:36.276 --> 04:39.737
Well, Vicky, it's a double celebration after all!

69
04:39.821 --> 04:40.780
Exactly! Isn't it amazing?

70
04:40.863 --> 04:43.992
Of all places, you happened to reunite with Aunt Vicky here in Albay.

71
04:44.867 --> 04:47.120
You can just call me Mom Vicky.

72
04:47.203 --> 04:49.372
Ah yes! Mom Vicky, I'm Mikoy.

73
04:49.455 --> 04:50.581
-Mikoy. -That's right.

74
04:50.665 --> 04:54.168
I'm Chiara's fiancé.

75
04:54.252 --> 04:57.213
Oh, really? You're getting married, dear?

76
04:58.506 --> 05:02.135
Yes! To my greatest love.

77
05:03.761 --> 05:06.180
Looks like I came at just the right time.

78
05:06.889 --> 05:08.933
With all due respect, Mom Vicky.

79
05:09.017 --> 05:11.352
How long will your vacation in the Philippines be?

80
05:12.103 --> 05:15.064
I'm never going back abroad.

81
05:15.648 --> 05:17.817
I've been a domestic helper there for so long,

82
05:17.900 --> 05:20.403
taking care of someone else's child.

83
05:21.070 --> 05:24.157
Now it's time for me to take care of my own child.

84
05:24.240 --> 05:25.116
Right, son?

85
05:25.199 --> 05:27.702
There you go! You really are the best mom!

86
05:27.785 --> 05:30.121
That's really great to hear!

87
05:30.204 --> 05:33.458
You deserve your early retirement, Mama Yaya.

88
05:33.541 --> 05:36.586
You've sacrificed so much all these years.

89
05:36.669 --> 05:42.050
I really hope you can make it to my wedding.

90
05:43.718 --> 05:44.552
Are you sure, dear?

91
05:46.554 --> 05:49.432
Is that okay with you, Mikoy?

92
05:51.267 --> 05:56.064
Who am I to say no to my sweetheart's Mama Yaya?

93
05:56.147 --> 05:59.484
Of course! You're more than welcome, Mom Vicky.

94
06:01.152 --> 06:01.986
Thank you.

95
06:02.070 --> 06:04.197
What a wonderful day this is!

96
06:04.280 --> 06:09.535
Vicky, I've got some kakanin and calamansi juice for you, too!

97
06:09.619 --> 06:13.247
-Right timing! -Go on.

98
06:13.331 --> 06:14.916
Perfect timing. There's biko!

99
06:14.999 --> 06:16.167
-You all are so good at that. -How did you find out?

100
06:16.250 --> 06:18.086
-How did you know? -That's what you're good at!

101
06:18.169 --> 06:19.462
You're still a child back then.

102
06:19.545 --> 06:20.755
Come on, Vicky, let's have a snack.

103
06:20.838 --> 06:21.839
Of course, Mom.

104
06:22.840 --> 06:24.592
Aunt Vicky, have some biko!

105
06:36.896 --> 06:41.359
I was assigned to La Morte Bianca's villa before.

106
06:42.360 --> 06:43.945
As a domestic worker.

107
06:46.197 --> 06:48.449
I didn't even know who they were.

108
06:49.534 --> 06:55.957
Until I found out I was working for the mafia.

109
06:57.667 --> 06:59.794
See? In-law was right all along.

110
06:59.877 --> 07:02.171
That La Morte Bianca is shameless.

111
07:02.255 --> 07:09.137
You know, heaven or hell, wherever she is now, I hope she stays there for good!

112
07:10.847 --> 07:14.016
That explains why you're the one who raised Chiara.

113
07:15.059 --> 07:16.936
I raised Donatello too.

114
07:18.396 --> 07:24.235
If only I could've kept them away back then, I would have.

115
07:28.948 --> 07:30.116
You want more, sweetheart?

116
07:31.200 --> 07:32.493
This is so good.

117
07:35.997 --> 07:39.333
This is so good. It really is, Mom!

118
07:40.293 --> 07:42.044
Go ahead, eat up!

119
07:42.128 --> 07:43.045
All right.

120
07:43.629 --> 07:45.756
Maybe you want more. You can take mine.

121
07:46.841 --> 07:48.676
Really? Sure!

122
08:38.809 --> 08:40.061
Just a little more.

123
08:41.103 --> 08:42.522
I'ts okay to cry.

124
08:43.356 --> 08:44.565
It won't make you weak.

125
08:47.527 --> 08:51.739
Here, have something to eat. Go on!

126
08:51.822 --> 08:54.116
You'll be training again later.

127
08:54.742 --> 08:55.952
Eat up!

128
09:06.712 --> 09:07.713
Here's yours.

129
09:08.381 --> 09:09.298
Thank you.

130
09:20.935 --> 09:22.937
Are you okay, Mom Vicky?

131
09:25.064 --> 09:26.440
Of course, Mikoy!

132
09:26.524 --> 09:31.028
I'm just so happy to be with my child,

133
09:31.112 --> 09:33.447
and also this girl I raised as my own.

134
09:37.952 --> 09:40.413
It's a small world after all.

135
10:01.475 --> 10:03.311
You guys take care of our guests.

136
10:07.356 --> 10:08.316
Perfect!

137
10:08.399 --> 10:09.108
Are you Viktor?

138
10:09.191 --> 10:10.109
Relax, boss!

139
10:10.818 --> 10:12.737
Senator wants us to welcome you.

140
10:19.785 --> 10:21.537
Chill out, boss!

141
10:21.621 --> 10:22.622
Sir Vik!

142
10:22.705 --> 10:23.706
Easy, boss!

143
10:25.333 --> 10:26.751
Easy, boss!

144
10:27.418 --> 10:28.336
Sir Vik!

145
10:34.342 --> 10:35.635
Mr. Viktor!

146
10:36.594 --> 10:38.262
Give us a smile!

147
10:39.055 --> 10:40.139
Okay, one more!

148
10:42.308 --> 10:43.684
Let's go. Just leave him.

149
10:45.603 --> 10:46.437
Sir Vik!

150
10:52.652 --> 10:53.736
Are you okay, boss?

151
11:01.202 --> 11:02.495
I'm staying right here.

152
11:04.372 --> 11:09.835
Could Senator Quentin finally be getting back at Viktor?

153
11:09.919 --> 11:11.921
Now's finally his chance!

154
11:12.004 --> 11:16.008
Ever since the Moravianos arrived in the Philippines,

155
11:16.592 --> 11:20.596
the Sinigang Cartel's operations have come to a halt!

156
11:21.138 --> 11:25.142
His side hustle got shut down, so now he's getting revenge!

157
11:25.726 --> 11:30.731
And he can get back at him by making Viktor's life miserable

158
11:30.815 --> 11:32.942
while his case is in court.

159
11:34.860 --> 11:40.324
But wouldn't going after Viktor put Senator Quintin's ties

160
11:40.408 --> 11:45.996
to the Sinigang Cartel at risk?

161
11:46.080 --> 11:49.458
Unless he has other plans for Viktor.

162
11:50.292 --> 11:56.424
Just like us, we're keeping him because he has valuable information for us.

163
11:58.175 --> 12:03.848
You mean, Senator Quintin needs something from Viktor?

164
12:05.891 --> 12:06.976
What could it be?

165
12:07.726 --> 12:11.439
Referrals to criminals in Europe?

166
12:11.522 --> 12:13.399
Business contacts?

167
12:15.025 --> 12:20.990
For a businessman posing as a public servant?

168
12:22.783 --> 12:25.119
What you are saying is not impossible.

169
12:36.755 --> 12:38.549
Sen. Look at this.

170
12:43.804 --> 12:47.725
YESTERDAY

171
12:49.018 --> 12:50.060
You know what?

172
12:50.144 --> 12:53.522
If this is effective for Chiara, well and good!

173
12:54.815 --> 12:55.900
And if not,

174
12:56.609 --> 12:59.737
well, we still have Donabel.

175
13:04.992 --> 13:06.368
Oh, that's panful!

176
13:06.452 --> 13:07.786
Especially that one.

177
13:13.125 --> 13:13.792
You know what?

178
13:13.876 --> 13:17.213
I can't remember any stories from Chiara about her Mama Yaya.

179
13:17.296 --> 13:18.464
Really?

180
13:20.299 --> 13:22.801
Maybe because Chiara was still young back then.

181
13:23.552 --> 13:26.138
She can't remember anything. Right?

182
13:27.097 --> 13:28.474
That's true.

183
13:28.557 --> 13:29.517
Or it also can be

184
13:29.600 --> 13:33.103
after all that Chiara went through as a child,

185
13:33.187 --> 13:35.356
she doesn't want to revisit those memories anymore.

186
13:36.357 --> 13:37.441
Can be.

187
13:37.525 --> 13:38.859
If you think about it,

188
13:38.943 --> 13:41.278
since she was a child, La Morte Bianca has been training her

189
13:41.362 --> 13:43.239
to fight and hold a gun.

190
13:43.822 --> 13:46.909
Too much, right? Her childhood is so traumatic.

191
13:49.411 --> 13:50.746
Let's just think about this.

192
13:52.706 --> 13:55.834
Look at Chiara now. She's so happy.

193
13:56.335 --> 13:57.628
That's right, Dad.

194
13:58.128 --> 14:00.548
After everything we've been through,

195
14:00.631 --> 14:03.259
I've never seen her this happy before.

196
14:06.011 --> 14:07.846
And because of that,

197
14:07.930 --> 14:12.393
we need to celebrate with a delicious dinner!

198
14:12.476 --> 14:13.727
-Yes! -Yes!

199
14:13.811 --> 14:16.814
Okay, okay! I'll head to the market while it's still light,

200
14:16.897 --> 14:19.441
and I'll pick up something to grill.

201
14:19.525 --> 14:20.568
-Ooh! -Wait, wait!

202
14:20.651 --> 14:23.654
Honey, could you buy me lots of tomatoes?

203
14:23.737 --> 14:25.948
-I'm making a salad. -Okay!

204
14:26.031 --> 14:28.701
Uncle Mario, get me some hotdogs too. For the kolokoys.

205
14:30.411 --> 14:31.495
All right, sure!

206
14:32.872 --> 14:35.332
Hey! Easy on the biko!

207
14:35.416 --> 14:36.375
Why?

208
14:36.458 --> 14:37.543
I missed this!

209
14:37.626 --> 14:39.587
Can you not? Mind your own snack!

210
14:40.170 --> 14:41.463
Wait, wait. Captain Pepe,

211
14:42.423 --> 14:43.674
you've been so quiet.

212
14:44.633 --> 14:46.135
He ate a lot too!

213
14:46.218 --> 14:47.219
He probably hasn't digested it yet, huh?

214
14:47.803 --> 14:48.721
It's not like that.

215
14:48.804 --> 14:50.055
Then what?

216
14:52.516 --> 14:55.019
It's just that Aunt Vicky isn't from around here.

217
14:55.102 --> 14:56.979
Why did she suddenly show up?

218
14:57.855 --> 14:59.732
Of course, she just got here.

219
15:00.524 --> 15:02.443
Yes, and Chiara knows her.

220
15:02.526 --> 15:03.736
She seems nice.

221
15:03.819 --> 15:05.487
And trustworthy too.

222
15:08.032 --> 15:11.118
I hope so. I hope you're right.

223
15:17.333 --> 15:18.876
This is unbelievable, Mama Yaya.

224
15:19.543 --> 15:22.004
I can't believe we're seeing each other again!

225
15:23.088 --> 15:25.466
What a coincidence, right?

226
15:26.175 --> 15:28.677
This is no coincidence, dear.

227
15:29.303 --> 15:31.639
None of this is a coincidence.

228
15:31.722 --> 15:33.724
Didn't I tell you before?

229
15:33.807 --> 15:37.811
There's something destined for each of us.

230
15:39.480 --> 15:40.940
It's time, Chiara.

231
15:41.023 --> 15:44.610
It's time for you to lead the Concordat.

232
15:49.114 --> 15:50.991
Whatever you have here,

233
15:52.117 --> 15:53.744
you need to leave it all behind.

234
15:54.286 --> 15:56.288
As soon as possible.

235
16:28.320 --> 16:29.238
Bro.

236
16:31.490 --> 16:35.202
I just hope that after you and Sis Chiara get married,

237
16:37.287 --> 16:38.580
I hope nothing changes.

238
16:42.042 --> 16:43.794
What's going to change?

239
16:46.130 --> 16:47.006
I don't know.

240
16:47.631 --> 16:48.799
It's just…

241
16:49.883 --> 16:51.010
You know how it is.

242
16:51.802 --> 16:53.512
You and Sis Chiara might get busy.

243
16:55.597 --> 16:56.765
And…

244
16:57.474 --> 16:59.810
Well, you might not have time for me anymore.

245
17:00.394 --> 17:02.104
We won't be able to hang out anymore.

246
17:03.063 --> 17:04.440
We won't be able to vlog together.

247
17:05.774 --> 17:08.152
Or go fishing here by the river.

248
17:11.947 --> 17:13.073
Listen, Rahmboy.

249
17:13.157 --> 17:15.534
Even after Chiara and I get married,

250
17:16.035 --> 17:18.370
I'll still be your brother, okay?

251
17:18.454 --> 17:21.248
And you, you'll still be a pain in my ass!

252
17:22.750 --> 17:25.794
Geez. You're something else, Bro.

253
17:26.503 --> 17:27.796
But okay.

254
17:28.422 --> 17:29.381
You're right.

255
17:30.591 --> 17:32.593
-You're right, anyway. -Nah, I'm just kidding!

256
17:32.676 --> 17:34.428
Of course, nothing will change!

257
17:34.511 --> 17:37.931
You know that, my Rahmboy! Oh, you.

258
17:39.099 --> 17:41.018
Now, enough being dramatic, okay?

259
17:41.101 --> 17:42.019
-I'm not! -Will you?

260
17:42.102 --> 17:42.978
I'm not being dramatic.

261
17:43.062 --> 17:44.229
-Yes, you are! -This is nothing!

262
17:45.022 --> 17:46.774
I'm just making sure.

263
17:50.194 --> 17:51.570
How do you do this again?

264
17:52.905 --> 17:54.031
Oh, Bro!

265
17:54.740 --> 17:56.575
Let's vlog first. This might be our last one.

266
17:56.658 --> 17:59.036
There you go again with the drama.

267
17:59.119 --> 17:59.995
What was that?

268
18:00.079 --> 18:01.413
-Huh? -There's someone back there.

269
18:01.497 --> 18:02.581
-Where? -They're wearing black!

270
18:02.664 --> 18:03.499
-Huh?! -There they are!

271
18:03.582 --> 18:05.042
-Bro! Bro! Wait! -Just come with us, bro!

272
18:05.125 --> 18:06.335
-Do not resist. -Bro!

273
18:07.002 --> 18:07.669
Quit fighting!

274
18:07.753 --> 18:08.837
What's happening?

275
18:08.921 --> 18:09.922
Help me!

276
18:10.005 --> 18:11.298
Chiara!

277
18:11.381 --> 18:13.425
Mom! Dad!

278
18:13.509 --> 18:15.260
Okay, okay, okay!

279
18:15.344 --> 18:16.386
Get in!

280
18:17.429 --> 18:18.639
Chiara!

281
18:22.392 --> 18:25.229
All right! Sounds like a success!

282
18:25.938 --> 18:27.606
Enjoy, Bro Mikoy!

283
18:27.689 --> 18:29.108
Really?

284
18:29.191 --> 18:30.818
Kidnapping again?

285
18:30.901 --> 18:32.486
Prague already traumatized me!

286
18:32.569 --> 18:33.570
Hey!

287
18:33.654 --> 18:35.572
Let me go!

288
18:35.656 --> 18:37.783
Help! Hey!

289
18:37.866 --> 18:39.493
Where are the girls?

290
18:40.369 --> 18:41.870
I told you they're not answering!

291
18:42.913 --> 18:45.332
Even the singers aren't picking up.

292
18:45.415 --> 18:46.875
They ghosted us. Angelito!

293
18:46.959 --> 18:48.836
Call this number, will you?

294
18:48.919 --> 18:50.129
Angelito?

295
18:50.212 --> 18:51.922
Oh, Bro, just keep quiet for a minute.

296
18:52.464 --> 18:53.382
Hey!

297
18:54.133 --> 18:55.175
I said quiet!

298
18:55.259 --> 18:58.720
Even the dancers and the girls I contacted have canceled.

299
18:58.804 --> 19:00.597
Because we haven't paid the down payment yet!

300
19:00.681 --> 19:03.142
We're only just starting to pool our money.

301
19:03.225 --> 19:05.269
Just put it on my tab for now, okay?

302
19:05.352 --> 19:06.812
See? That's what I'm talking about.

303
19:06.895 --> 19:08.856
Borrowing money again!

304
19:08.939 --> 19:12.734
Hold still! It's not even yet. Wait!

305
19:13.402 --> 19:15.404
Do I really need this?

306
19:18.198 --> 19:20.868
You know, Sis Chiara, you're so beautiful!

307
19:20.951 --> 19:22.536
Bro Mikoy is so lucky to have you.

308
19:24.538 --> 19:28.250
But I'm just as lucky to have him and all of you.

309
19:28.333 --> 19:30.919
Especially to the best maid of honor ever!

310
19:36.884 --> 19:37.718
Here!

311
19:38.677 --> 19:40.846
Let's solve this problem of yours.

312
19:41.763 --> 19:42.598
Solve our problem?

313
19:42.681 --> 19:43.599
Yes!

314
19:43.682 --> 19:45.559
You haven't even contributed!

315
19:45.642 --> 19:47.686
Exactly! You haven't even chipped in!

316
19:47.769 --> 19:50.063
This is my contribution! I'm making the calls!

317
19:50.564 --> 19:52.900
-Okay, then. -Cocoy!

318
19:52.983 --> 19:55.360
You've been drinking this whole time, and you haven't contributed anything too!

319
19:55.444 --> 19:56.528
Right!

320
19:59.907 --> 20:01.700
-Whoa, whoa, whoa! -Okay, okay, we're good!

321
20:01.783 --> 20:03.327
We will behave, we promise!

322
20:03.410 --> 20:04.494
It's okay now.

323
20:04.578 --> 20:06.914
Don't mess with Cocoy! Those muscles will be the death of you.

324
20:06.997 --> 20:07.748
We're screwed.

325
20:12.920 --> 20:14.087
Wait, I think that's them!

326
20:14.171 --> 20:16.048
-l'll get it. -No, I'll get it! I'll get it!

327
20:16.757 --> 20:19.760
Give me that chair. Chiara, come sit here for a bit!

328
20:19.843 --> 20:21.553
What's happening?

329
20:23.680 --> 20:25.098
Let's hide.

330
20:33.649 --> 20:35.234
What is that?

331
20:35.317 --> 20:37.027
Here it is!

332
21:00.676 --> 21:01.760
Wow!

333
21:10.143 --> 21:11.061
Wow!

334
23:12.349 --> 23:13.433
Hello, in-law!

335
23:14.226 --> 23:15.185
In-law.

336
23:18.647 --> 23:20.148
Is Chiara there?

337
23:20.232 --> 23:23.068
Aw, too bad she's not here.

338
23:23.151 --> 23:26.154
Come on! It's her bridal shower.

339
23:27.906 --> 23:30.951
Wait a minute. Do you need anything from her?

340
23:31.785 --> 23:33.578
Or is something wrong?

341
23:33.662 --> 23:34.955
Is something bothering you?

342
23:36.456 --> 23:38.792
Nothing! I just wanted to check in on her.

343
23:38.875 --> 23:41.503
Oh, she's definitely happy!

344
23:41.586 --> 23:43.964
She's so excited for her wedding.

345
23:45.340 --> 23:48.135
That's good to hear! Right?

346
23:49.386 --> 23:51.429
I'm happy that our children is happy!

347
23:51.513 --> 23:52.556
Oh.

348
23:53.765 --> 23:55.600
Ah, okay, in-law! Thank you so much!

349
23:55.684 --> 23:56.852
Take care over there. Good night!

350
23:56.935 --> 23:59.354
Oh, hey! You take care, too. Wait, I have something--

351
24:01.690 --> 24:02.524
Hello?

352
24:04.276 --> 24:05.443
In-law?

353
24:10.699 --> 24:13.451
They've stolen so many years from you, my child.

354
24:14.911 --> 24:17.581
I won't do away with your happiness for now.

355
24:18.582 --> 24:22.294
You deserve to be happy, Chiara. My daughter.

356
24:23.795 --> 24:25.172
Viktor,

357
24:25.964 --> 24:27.549
wherever you are,

358
24:28.091 --> 24:31.011
promise me you'll come back.

359
24:51.656 --> 24:55.577
There's something destined for each of us.

360
24:55.660 --> 24:58.997
It's time for you to lead the Concordat.

361
25:09.758 --> 25:12.260
Why did you really come back, Mama Yaya?

362
25:12.344 --> 25:14.471
You know why I came back.

363
25:19.893 --> 25:22.354
Let's see who you're hiding, Sean.

364
25:29.778 --> 25:31.112
The world really is a small place, huh?

365
25:31.196 --> 25:33.365
Who would've thought your Mama Yaya would turn out to be Rahmboy's mother?

366
25:33.448 --> 25:35.659
Even I was surprised.

367
25:36.493 --> 25:39.913
How come you never told me about your Mama Yaya?

368
25:39.996 --> 25:44.209
To be honest, I just never thought we'd see each other again.

369
25:44.292 --> 25:46.378
I'm glad you found each other again.

370
25:46.461 --> 25:47.504
Right?

371
25:50.048 --> 25:51.132
Let me go,

372
25:51.216 --> 25:53.468
so we can talk normally, Carlota. Please.
